#
# --- THE JDK, OBSERVED RATHER THAN INFERRED ----------------------------------
#
# The field most often filled in from a reasonable-sounding assumption, and
# wrong in BOTH directions. AAP 0.4.1 and 0.8.2 use this exact tool as the
# counter-example because the harness PRECEDENT exported JAVA_HOME_21 for it -
# but that is a different provisioning. THIS one assigns 17 and says so in its
# own text, so 21 would be as wrong here as 17 would be there. Three
# independent readings, all agreeing.
#
