#
# --- THE BAKED FLAG SET, AS READ ---------------------------------------------
#
# Read out of harness/bin/run-dependency-check.sh lines 51-57 and corroborated
# against the argv of the process that ran. Nothing in this set was added,
# removed or forced, and none of it is an AAP expected-values anchor
# (AAP 0.4.2). An analyzer set is only known once the absences are known, so
