#
# --- CREDENTIALS --------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Names only. No value appears in this file, and none can: the runner reports
# presence through scope_cred_state, which uses ${VAR:+set} and prints exactly
# 'set' or 'absent'. The ${VAR:-absent} form would emit the variable's own
# value in its set-arm, into a log this pipeline preserves verbatim.
#
